518
00:32:12,304 --> 00:32:16,764
When you put them in, they start to rise.

519
00:32:16,764 --> 00:32:20,144
Then, turn it slowly.

520
00:32:20,144 --> 00:32:23,964
I'm going to let it get airy.

521
00:32:23,964 --> 00:32:25,304
Okay, here we go.

522
00:32:25,304 --> 00:32:26,304
Put in half of the oil.

523
00:32:26,304 --> 00:32:33,184
Slowly.

524
00:32:34,436 --> 00:32:39,436
