526
00:32:43,436 --> 00:32:45,436
That's good, right?

527
00:32:45,436 --> 00:32:49,436
This one! And this one!

528
00:32:49,436 --> 00:32:51,436
Nice! It's so fluffy!

529
00:32:51,436 --> 00:32:55,436
That's good! I've never seen eggs like this!

530
00:32:55,436 --> 00:32:57,436
Maybe it's okay.

531
00:32:57,436 --> 00:32:59,436
I'll put this one out.

532
00:33:01,436 --> 00:33:03,436
Oh, my gosh! So fluffy!

533
00:33:04,276 --> 00:33:08,776
I've mastered the Miyagi point!

534
00:33:08,776 --> 00:33:09,896
That's what I'm talking about!

535
00:33:09,896 --> 00:33:16,356
Well, that's all for this time!

536
00:33:16,372 --> 00:33:18,372
