00:35:09,268 --> 00:35:11,968
This is really true.

575
00:35:11,968 --> 00:35:14,608
I'm also a sophomore.

576
00:35:14,608 --> 00:35:16,768
Maybe I'm wrong, too, but...

577
00:35:16,768 --> 00:35:19,268
I'm in the second grade.

578
00:35:19,268 --> 00:35:24,668
But when I went to my first lesson, I was imitating the other trainees who had joined with me.

579
00:35:24,668 --> 00:35:29,948
But when I went to my first lesson, I imitated the other trainees who had joined with me.

